  "ruleText": "Rev 211.03 Notice. Notice for public comment hearing concerning rulemaking, as required by RSA 541-A:6, shall be commenced by placing notice of the hearing in the register, in accordance with RSA 541-A:9.\n\nSource. #6124, eff 11-23-95; ss by #6749, eff 5-19-98; EXPIRED: 5-19-06\n\nNew. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06 (formerly Rev 219.03); ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
